      q: "Consider an Ethernet segment with a transmission speed of 10^8 bits/sec and a maximum segment length of 500 meters. If the speed of propagation of the signal in the medium is 2×10^8 meters/sec, then the minimum frame size (in bits) required for collision detection is _________",
      options: [],
